efix k d},\n              RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.GenuineBoundaryPair cuts R chi y z v →\n                RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.IsPrefix v x →\n                  RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.Legal cuts R x →\n                    ∀ (slots : Finset ℤ) (W : Finset A),\n                      W.Nonempty →\n                        ∀ (a : ℕ) {E : ℝ},\n                          Real.log ↑W.card / TimeProfile.logScale N +\n                                    4 * RiffleUpperV2.Localization.meanExponent N cuts R x -\n                                  RiffleUpperV2.Localization.boundaryFluctuation N cuts R v -\n                                2 * RiffleUpperV2.empiricalB N a cuts ⋯ 2 (a + ↑x.fst) (a + d) ≤\n                              E →\n                            ↑W.card * RiffleUpperV2.Localization.anchoredDensity cuts c₀ R x slots ≤\n                              4 * √(RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.varianceDenominator chi v / g) * ↑N ^ E +\n                                ↑W.card *\n                                  (6 * ↑slots.card *\n                                    Real.exp\n                                      (-RiffleLowerV2.chernoffConstant * g * RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.sideScale cuts R v))"}
