pperV2.Anchor.leftScale cuts R v ∧\n              0 < RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.rightScale cuts R v ∧\n                ∃ (i : Fin ↑x.fst) (j : Fin ↑x.fst),\n                  RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.leftMean cuts R x i = RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.leftScale cuts R v ∧\n                    RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.rightMean cuts R x j = RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.rightScale cuts R v),\n          RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.leftMean cuts R x (Classical.choose ⋯) = RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.leftScale cuts R v ∧\n              RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.rightMean cuts R x (Classical.choose ⋯) = RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.rightScale cuts R v →\n            g * RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.sideScale cuts R v / (16 * RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.varianceDenominator χ v) ≤\n                g * RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.sideScale cuts R v / (8 * RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.varianceDenominator χ v) →\n              g * min (RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.leftScale cuts R v) (RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.rightScale cuts R v) /\n                    (8 * RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.varianceDenominator χ v) ≤\n                  g * RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.leftScale cuts R v * RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.rightScale cuts R v /\n                    (8 * ↑R.card) →\n                ↑(Classical.choose ⋯) < ↑(Classical.choose ⋯) →\n                  ∀ (ω : RiffleUpperV2.Sample cuts),\n                    (RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.exactUnequalReveal cuts RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.SuffixSide.lower c₀ R x\n                            (Classical.choose ⋯) (Classical.choose ⋯)).good\n                        ω →\n                      g * RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.sideScale cuts R v /\n                          (16 * RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.varianceDenominator χ v) ≤\n                        ((RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.exactUnequalReveal cuts RiffleUpperV2.Anchor.SuffixSide.lower c₀ R x\n                                (Classical.choose ⋯) (Classical.choose ⋯)).params\n                            ω).varianceFormula"}
