eUpperV2.Reservoir.Backward.tailCollisions","type":"∀ (k D : ℕ),\n  0 < k →\n    1 ≤ D →\n      ∀ (g τ T : ℝ),\n        0 < g →\n          g < 1 →\n            0 < τ →\n              τ < g →\n                0 < T →\n                  Real.log (1 / g) / Real.log (1 / τ) < 1 / 2 →\n                    ∃ (C2 : ℝ),\n                      0 < C2 ∧\n                        ∃ (N0 : ℕ),\n                          1 ≤ N0 ∧\n                            ∀ (n : ℕ),\n                              N0 ≤ n →\n                                ∀ (L : ℕ),\n                                  ↑(L + 1) ≤ T * Real.log ↑n →\n                                    ∀ (cuts : RiffleUpperV2.Cuts k n (L + 1)) (hn : 0 < n),\n                                      TimeProfile.GoodColumn (TimeProfile.Cuts.profile cuts hn 0) g →\n                                        ∀ (ξ ε : ℝ),\n                                          0 ≤ ε →\n                                            ∀ (p : Fin k) (ω : RiffleUpperV2.Sample cuts)\n                                              (j : Fin (RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.pileSize cuts p)),\n                                              RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.positiveHistory cuts p\n                                                  RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.Direction.backward (↑j + 1) ω →\n                                                RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.historyGood cuts D g ξ ε p\n                                                    RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.Direction.backward (↑j + 1) ω →\n                                                  RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.hasDirection cuts D g\n                                                      RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.Direction.backward\n                                                      (RiffleUpperV2.Reservoir.backwardWords cuts p ω j) →\n                                                    ∀ (E : ℕ) (v : RiffleUpperV2.Word k (min E L)),\n                                                      (∀ (w : RiffleUpperV2.Word k (L + 1)),\n                                                          List.Vector.get w 0 = p →\n                                                            RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.tailPrefix E w = v →\n                                                              w < RiffleUpperV2.Reservoir.backwardWords cuts p ω j) →\n                                                        RiffleUpperV2.conditionalExpect\n                                                            (RiffleUpperV2.fixedCountPMF cuts)\n                                                            (fun (z : TimeProfile.ShuffleSample cuts) =>\n                                                              ∑ w : RiffleUpperV2.Word k (L + 1),\n                                                                if\n                                                                    List.take\n                                                                        (↑(RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.tailBinPrefix E p\n                                                                              v).fst)\n                                                                        (List.Vector.toList w) =\n                                                                      List.Vector.toList\n                                                                        (RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.tailBinPrefix E p\n                                                                            v).snd then\n                                                                  ↑((RiffleUpperV2.Reservoir.wordCount z w).choose 2)\n                                                                else 0)\n                                                            (RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.historyFiber cuts p\n                                                              RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.Direction.backward (↑j + 1) ω) ≤\n                                                          C2 * ↑n ^ 2 *\n                                                                RiffleUpperV2.prefixMass cuts\n                                                                    (RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.tailBinPrefix E p v) ^\n                                                                  (2 * (1 - Real.log (1 / g) / Real.log (1 / τ))) *\n                                                              RiffleUpperV2.Reservoir.tailPowerMass cuts\n                                                                (RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.tailBinPrefix E p v)\n                                                                (2 * (1 - Real.log (1 / g) / Real.log (1 / τ))) +\n                                                            ↑n ^ 2 * ε"}
