n\n                                              (fun (a : Fin k) => RiffleUpperV2.Hypergeometric.anchorRows c a) C chi\n                                              delta hchiK) =>\n                                        (↑t.snd).2.2)\n                                      s).fst)\n                              (a₀ + (d + 1)) ≤\n                        -eta + 8 * delta + 21 * RiffleUpperV2.Localization.crossingPenalty N chi / 2 +\n                          (4 * width + 4 * Real.log ↑k * TimeProfile.exceptionalAllowance chi)"}
